{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27228","headline":"道者与金丹开合已失因爲二首再有投掷 一 · 章孝标","name":"道者与金丹开合已失因爲二首再有投掷 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"木钻钻盘石，辛勤四十年。\n一朝才见物，五色互呈妍。\n七魄憎阳盛，三彭恶命延。\n被他迷失却，叹息只澘然。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"章孝标","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27228.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27228","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}